<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-τείνω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαντ-</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Orph.
			<u>A.</u>
			61
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			332
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretch out
				and hold up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τράχηλον,</span>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερανα-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.4.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰς χεῖρας,</span> as in
			prayer, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				32.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
			</span></i>ll.cc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐλπίδας τινί</span>
			<i>hold out</i> hopes, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.1.23
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> freq. in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανατείνεσθαι σίδηρόν τινι</span>”
				<i>brandish threatingly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PHal.
					1.186
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάκτρον τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.196b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φόβους τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.44.3
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τι πράξειν</span>
			<i>threaten</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				15.29.14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1408.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>speak with prolixity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				8.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>set oneself up, rebel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				7.14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
